  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n25x2 + 16y2 + 9z2 - 40xy + 24yz - 30zx\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n(a + b + c)² = a² + b² + c² + 2ab + 2bc + 2ca\n\n**Calculations:**\n\n25x2 + 16y2 + 9z2 - 40xy + 24yz - 30zx\n\n= (5x)2 + (4y)2 + (3z)2 - 2(5x)(4y) + 2(4y)(3z) - 2(3z)(5x)\n\n= (- 5x)2 + (4y)2 + (3z)2 + 2(- 5x)(4y) + 2(4y)(3z) + 2(3z)(- 5x)\n\n= (- 5x + 4y + 3z)²\n\n= (4y + 3z - 5x)2\n\n**Hence, The Required Expression is (4y + 3z - 5x)2**",
